#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:5 a7ad1efc04fa41669fbd24b881eacfdb
msgid "_`Usage`"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:7 2090c2fef07a4833ba7802c5db9ccd06
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The conanfile.py is the Conan package configuration file for the "
"stereo_vision project, responsible for dependency management, package "
"metadata processing, and module generation."
msgstr "conanfile.py 是 fcpp 项目的 Conan 包配置文件，负责依赖管理、包元数据处理以及模块生成。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:11 5fe42b615dba408eb90fc3a8f4ddf427
msgid "_`Main Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:13 8731cd734d3e42019133dd8c0792268a
msgid "Project metadata initialization"
msgstr "项目元数据初始化"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:14 0a3bacb6fb624e96bc208f73280317b2
msgid "Dependency management"
msgstr "依赖管理"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:15 08854ca722c3400daa29876df7636e61
msgid "Module file generation and processing"
msgstr "模块文件生成与处理"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:16 a8883c92ce2c47f8a6f8e76c3c319c63
msgid "Build configuration generation"
msgstr "构建配置生成"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:17 b0f8e643f82546bba805397b33031a36
msgid "Package information definition"
msgstr "包信息定义"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:20 9f415d8056764f25b824064d9c06c1c6
msgid "_`Core Functionality`"
msgstr "核心功能"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:22 ed12f589b317480987317d61bbb14ac7
msgid ""
"The PackageRecipe class handles project initialization by loading "
"information from metadata.json. It processes module files by generating "
"them from .hpp and .cpp files, handling export and attach markers. "
"Dependency management is implemented by loading requirements from "
"conandata.yml."
msgstr ""
"PackageRecipe 类通过从 metadata.json 加载信息来处理项目初始化。它通过从.hpp 和 .cpp "
"文件生成模块文件来处理它们，并处理导出（export）和附加（attach）标记。依赖管理是通过从 conandata.yml 加载需求来实现的。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:26 482b67a728ec4c39a1f581f98b9dc7d5
msgid ""
"The configuration generates CMake toolchain and dependencies files, and "
"defines package components with their dependencies. Special features "
"include C header compatibility processing and comment marker handling for"
" export/attach operations."
msgstr "该配置会生成 CMake 工具链和依赖文件，并定义带有依赖关系的包组件。特殊功能包括C 头文件兼容性处理以及用于导出/附加操作的注释标记处理。"

